  "fragment": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-rel-prime-pols}\nLet $k$ be a field. Let $F, G \\in k[X, Y]$ be homogeneous\nof degrees $d, e$. Assume $F, G$ relatively prime.\nThen multiplication by $G$ is injective on $S = k[X, Y]/(F)$.\n\\end{lemma}",
